27330      * Separate Intercepts;
27331      proc transreg data=Gas solve ss2 additive;
27332      model identity(nox) = class(Fuel / zero=none)
27333      spline(EqRatio / nknots=4);
27334      run;

NOTE: Since the model contains SMOOTH, BSPLINE, PBSPLINE, or a CLASS expansion with ZERO=NONE, a model with an implicit intercept is fit.
