27339      title 'Introductory Main-Effects ANOVA Example';
27340      data a;
27341      input y x1 $ x2 $;
27342      datalines;

NOTE: The data set WORK.A has 12 observations and 3 variables.

27355      ;
27356      * Fit a main-effects ANOVA model with 1, 0, -1 coding;
27357      proc transreg ss2;
27358      model identity(y) = class(x1 x2 / effects);
27359      output coefficients replace;
27360      run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.DATA31 has 14 observations and 9 variables.
